23. The person has this round-up in plan mode. Nothing may change files: investigate by reading the repo yourself and with read-only agents. While plan mode lasts, spawn_agent and message_agent refuse writers and browser agents, and muster_agents refuses. When your plan is ready (the units you would run as agents, writers marked), write it to your plan file and put it to the person with ExitPlanMode. If they approve it, the round-up has left plan mode: carry the plan out at once. If they don't, their reply says what to change. Review threads need writers too: if the person submits a review meanwhile, tell them the fixes wait until the plan is approved."
